<title>BRAZIL: MOTORCYCLING-BRAZILIAN GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-BRAZILIAN GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading qualifying times on</p>
<p>Saturday after the second and final practice for Sunday's</p>
<p>Brazilian 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix:</p>
<p>1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda  one minute 51.955 seconds</p>
<p>(average speed 158.624 kilometres per hour)</p>
<p> 2. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha		   1:52.353</p>
<p> 3. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda		     1:52.464</p>
<p> 4. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda		   1:52.495</p>
<p> 5. Doriano Romboni (Italy) Aprilia		1:52.653</p>
<p> 6. Jean Michel Bayle (France) Modenas KR3     1:52.991</p>
<p> 7. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda		    1:53.030</p>
<p> 8. Daryl Beattie (Australia) Suzuki	     1:53.111</p>
<p> 9. Anthony Gobert (Australia) Suzuki	    1:53.196</p>
<p> 10. Sete Gibernau (Spain) Yamaha		  1:53.386</p>
